      "rationale": "This is the terminating equation of the mathematical rolling-window summary advanceTo: once I is past N, the summarized result is the current fourth window value D.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-5cc3e0ae6b7118293dd931bf635194d53f57c1309f9ec680ca0d1c001d3ae38b",
      "start_line": 9,
      "text": "  rule advanceTo(_A, _B, _C, D, I, N) => D\n    requires I >Int N"
    },
    {
      "attributes": [],
      "classification": "DEFINITION",
      "end_line": 13,
      "module": "VERIFICATION",
      "normalized_sha256": "93cd0d07db0a86b368698f125bebf6ffa436d79b0501ddb7e154f6a154b261a7",
      "rationale": "This is the recursive equation defining advanceTo: it shifts the four-value window, inserts the sum of the window, increments I, and continues the mathematical summary.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-93cd0d07db0a86b368698f125bebf6ffa436d79b0501ddb7e154f6a154b261a7",
      "start_line": 11,
      "text": "  rule advanceTo(A, B, C, D, I, N)\n    => advanceTo(B, C, D, A +Int B +Int C +Int D, I +Int 1, N)\n    requires I <=Int N"
    },
    {
      "attributes": [],
      "classification": "DEFINITION",
      "end_line": 18,
      "module": "VERIFICATION",
      "normalized_sha256": "b6e0487f643fca471a37bb04d8910d1be4814258480f104b1acf4cf0273ee628",
